# Expected linter findings over the fixtures: one "<linter> <code>"
# line per finding, sorted. Every entry is intentional bait, recorded
# in VERDICTS.md under the rule it baits. Regenerate with
# ./lint.sh --update-baseline after changing a fixture on purpose.
eslint no-empty
eslint no-unused-vars
luacheck W111
luacheck W212
luacheck W212
luacheck W231
ruff BLE001
ruff S110
shellcheck SC2034
shellcheck SC2034
